 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2017-08-01",
   "text": "Empowering Medicare Seniors to Negotiate Drug Prices Act of 2017\n This bill amends title XVIII (Medicare) of the Social Security Act to allow the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services to: (1) negotiate drug prices under the Medicare prescription drug benefit, and (2) institute a price structure for the reimbursement of drugs covered under the benefit."
  }
 ],
